    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885790/extras/a11541b596806535bc53d4427377feac.poster.avif?t=1729051371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885790/extras/a11541b596806535bc53d4427377feac.webm?t=1729051371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885790/extras/a11541b596806535bc53d4427377feac.mp4?t=1729051371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Perhaps one day, you might find yourself in a strange land, feeling helpless and alone. In this world, you are known as Ayni.<br><br>Each world in this game has only one tool, and you must use it to overcome any challenge.<br><br>In the Bubble World, there are Bubble Generating Agencies that you can use to float in the sky and complete all the challenges. These devices can also slow down your descent and protect you.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885790/extras/2a32055bb7dd8bdc9005985ed8893e1d.avif?t=1729051371\" /></div><br><br>In the Hot World, there is a Fire Column Switch that controls the movement of walls and land, enabling you to navigate the entire scene and pass through levels. The core challenge of this chapter is designing through bubbles, while the core challenge of the Flame World is using the switch - fire can turn it on or off.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885790/extras/99b120bca0455f496d9aa858bb248b1b.avif?t=1729051371\" /></div><br><br>You can purchase various roles from the store, including a ninja, a bear man, an eggshell gentleman, future No. 1, Miku, and more.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885790/extras/934e88eceeee7db2b914a8157db8aa26.avif?t=1729051371\" /></div><br><br>Different challenges reflect different principles that can inspire you to think about real-life situations. As you explore the world, you'll encounter interesting challenges that go beyond your imagination. Of course, there are also dangerous and exciting challenges, such as dealing with the Lords of Element.<br><br>Each level may look small, but it requires you to activate your brain to complete it. If you get stuck, you can open the in-game tips to get inspired.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tShort, intricately designed levels.<br></li><li>\tUnpredictable ways to pass each level.<br></li><li>\tYou can do almost anything with just one kind of trap - it requires some imagination!<br></li><li>\tLearn how to do things in each challenge by reading the level.<br></li><li>\tFind the roles you like in the store.<br></li><li>\tEnjoy easy, wonderful music that plays at random.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready and Go!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "Perhaps one day, you might find yourself in a strange land, feeling helpless and alone. In this world, you are known as Ayni.<br><br>Each world in this game has only one tool, and you must use it to overcome any challenge.<br><br>In the Bubble World, there are Bubble Generating Agencies that you can use to float in the sky and complete all the challenges. These devices can also slow down your descent and protect you.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885790/extras/2a32055bb7dd8bdc9005985ed8893e1d.avif?t=1729051371\" /></div><br><br>In the Hot World, there is a Fire Column Switch that controls the movement of walls and land, enabling you to navigate the entire scene and pass through levels. The core challenge of this chapter is designing through bubbles, while the core challenge of the Flame World is using the switch - fire can turn it on or off.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885790/extras/99b120bca0455f496d9aa858bb248b1b.avif?t=1729051371\" /></div><br><br>You can purchase various roles from the store, including a ninja, a bear man, an eggshell gentleman, future No. 1, Miku, and more.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885790/extras/934e88eceeee7db2b914a8157db8aa26.avif?t=1729051371\" /></div><br><br>Different challenges reflect different principles that can inspire you to think about real-life situations. As you explore the world, you'll encounter interesting challenges that go beyond your imagination. Of course, there are also dangerous and exciting challenges, such as dealing with the Lords of Element.<br><br>Each level may look small, but it requires you to activate your brain to complete it. If you get stuck, you can open the in-game tips to get inspired.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tShort, intricately designed levels.<br></li><li>\tUnpredictable ways to pass each level.<br></li><li>\tYou can do almost anything with just one kind of trap - it requires some imagination!<br></li><li>\tLearn how to do things in each challenge by reading the level.<br></li><li>\tFind the roles you like in the store.<br></li><li>\tEnjoy easy, wonderful music that plays at random.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready and Go!</h2>",
